{"id":"fba702593996a2b2","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-local-T-schema.md","title":"理论内逐实例去引号","display":"df-local-T-schema — 理论内逐实例去引号","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-local-T-schema","aliases":["91-df-local-T-schema"],"display":"df-local-T-schema — 理论内逐实例去引号","depends_on":["[[91-df-T-schema]]","[[91-df-global-T-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-local-T-schema"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-local-T-schema</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-local-T-schema — 理论内逐实例去引号"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1b726801dacf2b8e\" href=\"?note=1b726801dacf2b8e\" title=\"91-df-global-T-schema\">91-df-global-T-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-local-T-schema-—-理论内逐实例去引号-$\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{loc}}$\">df-local-T-schema — 理论内逐实例去引号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{loc}}\">\\(\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{loc}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\)</span> (含真理谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的理论)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (指定的句子域)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\mathcal T_T,\\mathcal D)\">\\(\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\mathcal T_T,\\mathcal D)\\)</span> 是下述定义的二元元层理论性质缩写，参数依次为理论与许可句子域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{loc}\">\\(\\mathrm{loc}\\)</span> 标明逐实例的理论可证性。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\mathcal T_T,\\mathcal D)\n\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal D\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\mathcal T_T,\\mathcal D)\n\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal D\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里的量化在元层遍历实例；每个括号内表达一个对象理论可证性主张。\n它不是对象语言中直接量化“所有公式”的单句。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal D=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> 时，TB、UTB 等可以安全地\n满足该性质。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathcal D=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>，\n并同时采用经典逻辑与对角引理，则说谎者 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 给出</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\nT(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)\\leftrightarrow\\lambda,\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\nT(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)\\leftrightarrow\\lambda,\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>从而不一致。因此每次使用局部 T-schema 都必须标出实例域和背景逻辑；\n“理论内部”本身既不使它更强，也不使它更安全。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-local-T-schema-—-理论内逐实例去引号-$\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{loc}}$","text":"df-local-T-schema — 理论内逐实例去引号 $\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{loc}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-global-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"1b726801dacf2b8e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-global-T-schema]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{loc}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\mathcal T_T,\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{loc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\mathcal T_T,\\mathcal D)\n\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal D\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal D=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\nT(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)\\leftrightarrow\\lambda,\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner),","display":true}],"bytes":1727,"backlinks":[{"id":"1b726801dacf2b8e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"“全局”在本条目中只表示元理论一次指定整个实例族；它仍是公理模式，\n不是对象语言中量化公式的单个句子，也不自带任何推导关系。\n若要断言一个具体理论 $\\mathcal T_T$ 证明每个实例，应使用\n[[91-df-local-T-schema]] 所定义的理论性质。"},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-local-T-schema]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-local-T-schema]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-induction.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-logic.md]]\n[[91-df